msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"Weren't you the guy who was with that reporter? What do you\r\n"
"want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"He told me about the case. I'm helping him look for\r\n"
"information to try and prove your brother's innocence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Huh? What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"He feels responsible, so we're looking for a way to help\r\n"
"your brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Oh, really? Well, you're too late! My brother's been in\r\n"
"prison for six years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Do you think you can just waltz up to me and pretend\r\n"
"to care now? Just leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Now you want to prove my brother's innocence? A little late,\r\n"
"isn't it!? I don't need any help from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"(I bet I'd be angry, too. Guess we'll just have to work\r\n"
"separately...)"
msgstr ""

